      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. Never. I've the kids to think of.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:48",
      "end_timestamp": "02:52",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Asthma. Since I was a child. It's been quiet.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:04",
      "end_timestamp": "03:09",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Asthma, quiet at the moment. Good. And family history, what did your father die of, if you don't mind me asking?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:10",
      "end_timestamp": "03:22",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Lung cancer. He smoked all his life.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:24",
      "end_timestamp": "03:28",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My sister had breast cancer. She's well now, thank God.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:39",
      "end_timestamp": "03:44",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I run the farm with my husband. Two kids at home, they're ten and thirteen.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:55",
      "end_timestamp": "04:04",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]",
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So you're busy with the farm and the children. And are you leaning on anything to get through the evenings, drink or otherwise?",
      "start_timestamp": "04:06",
      "end_timestamp": "04:18",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'm drinking a bit more in the evenings. A glass of whiskey, maybe two.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:19",
      "end_timestamp": "04:27",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'll order the blood tests for you, and you can have them done at the front desk before you go.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:32",
      "end_timestamp": "05:43",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd recommend it. I'll refer you to the bereavement service, and they'll ring you within a fortnight. Would you be happy to talk to someone?",
      "start_timestamp": "05:48",
      "end_timestamp": "06:01",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your mam sounds sensible. Now, on the sleep. No screens in the last hour, same time to bed every night, and keep the whiskey for the weekend, if at all.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:11",
      "end_timestamp": "06:28",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Understood. I'd like to see you again in three weeks, to see how the sleep is, and to go through the blood results.",
